{"seq":1,"slug":"location-intelligence","title":"位置智能","url":"/l-doc-books/h/data-science/geospatial-data-analysis/applied-geospatial/location-intelligence","wordCount":1081,"readingTime":5,"html":"<h1 id=\"位置智能\">位置智能</h1><h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>位置智能（Location Intelligence）是将地理空间分析融入商业决策的实践。它结合地理数据、业务数据和空间分析技术，帮助企业回答「在哪里」的问题——从零售选址、物流优化到市场扩展策略。位置智能的核心价值在于将空间维度纳入传统商业分析框架，揭示数据中隐藏的地理模式和机会。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;    A[位置智能] --&gt; B[数据层]&#10;    A --&gt; C[分析层]&#10;    A --&gt; D[决策层]&#10;    B --&gt; E[POI 数据]&#10;    B --&gt; F[人口统计]&#10;    B --&gt; G[交通数据]&#10;    B --&gt; H[竞品数据]&#10;    C --&gt; I[选址分析]&#10;    C --&gt; J[贸易区分析]&#10;    C --&gt; K[空间聚类]&#10;    D --&gt; L[开店决策]&#10;    D --&gt; M[营销策略]&#10;    D --&gt; N[供应链优化]\">graph TD\n    A[位置智能] --&gt; B[数据层]\n    A --&gt; C[分析层]\n    A --&gt; D[决策层]\n    B --&gt; E[POI 数据]\n    B --&gt; F[人口统计]\n    B --&gt; G[交通数据]\n    B --&gt; H[竞品数据]\n    C --&gt; I[选址分析]\n    C --&gt; J[贸易区分析]\n    C --&gt; K[空间聚类]\n    D --&gt; L[开店决策]\n    D --&gt; M[营销策略]\n    D --&gt; N[供应链优化]</pre><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>应用领域</th>\n<th>核心问题</th>\n<th>关键数据</th>\n<th>分析方法</th>\n<th>业务价值</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>零售选址</td>\n<td>在哪开店</td>\n<td>POI、人流、竞品</td>\n<td>引力模型、Huff</td>\n<td>提升单店营收</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>物流配送</td>\n<td>如何分配路线</td>\n<td>路网、订单</td>\n<td>VRP、TSP</td>\n<td>降低配送成本</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>保险定价</td>\n<td>哪里风险高</td>\n<td>灾害、人口</td>\n<td>风险面插值</td>\n<td>精准定价</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>市场营销</td>\n<td>哪里有客户</td>\n<td>消费、人口</td>\n<td>空间聚类</td>\n<td>精准投放</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>城市规划</td>\n<td>如何配置设施</td>\n<td>人口、交通</td>\n<td>可达性分析</td>\n<td>公共服务均等化</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"商圈与贸易区分析\">商圈与贸易区分析</h2><h3 id=\"huff-引力模型\">Huff 引力模型</h3><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"python\" data-code=\"import numpy as np&#10;&#10;def huff_model(store_areas, store_distances, alpha=1.0, beta=2.0):&#10;    attractiveness = store_areas ** alpha&#10;    distance_decay = store_distances ** beta&#10;    utility = attractiveness / distance_decay&#10;    probabilities = utility / utility.sum(axis=1, keepdims=True)&#10;    return probabilities&#10;&#10;store_areas = np.array([5000, 3000, 8000])&#10;customer_distances = np.array([&#10;    [1.0, 2.5, 3.0],&#10;    [2.0, 1.5, 4.0],&#10;    [3.5, 3.0, 1.0],&#10;])&#10;&#10;probs = huff_model(store_areas, customer_distances)\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">import</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> numpy </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">as</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> np</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">def</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> huff_model</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(store_areas, store_distances, alpha</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">1.0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, beta</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">2.0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">):</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    attractiveness </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> store_areas </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">**</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> alpha</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    distance_decay </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> store_distances </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">**</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> beta</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    utility </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> attractiveness </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">/</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> distance_decay</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    probabilities </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> utility </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">/</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> utility.sum(</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">axis</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">1</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">keepdims</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">True</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    return</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> probabilities</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">store_areas </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> np.array([</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">5000</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">3000</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">8000</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">])</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">customer_distances </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> np.array([</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    [</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">1.0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">2.5</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">3.0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">],</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    [</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">2.0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">1.5</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">4.0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">],</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    [</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">3.5</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">3.0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">1.0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">],</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">])</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">probs </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> huff_model(store_areas, customer_distances)</span></span></code></pre></div><p>Huff 模型的两个关键参数需要根据实际业务校准：<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>α</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\alpha</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0037em;\">α</span></span></span></span></span> 控制吸引力指标（如面积）的影响强度，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>β</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\beta</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8889em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0528em;\">β</span></span></span></span></span> 控制距离衰减的速度。<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>β</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\beta</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8889em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0528em;\">β</span></span></span></span></span> 值越大，消费者对距离越敏感——日常消费品（如便利店）的 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>β</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\beta</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8889em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0528em;\">β</span></span></span></span></span> 通常较大（2-3），而目的性消费（如家具卖场）的 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>β</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\beta</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8889em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0528em;\">β</span></span></span></span></span> 较小（1-2）。参数校准通常使用已知的客户来源数据进行最大似然估计。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>贸易区类型</th>\n<th>定义</th>\n<th>客户覆盖率</th>\n<th>用途</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>核心贸易区</td>\n<td>最近 60-70% 客户</td>\n<td>60-70%</td>\n<td>核心客群定位</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>次要贸易区</td>\n<td>接下来 20-25%</td>\n<td>80-90%</td>\n<td>营销重点区域</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>边缘贸易区</td>\n<td>剩余客户</td>\n<td>90-100%</td>\n<td>品牌辐射范围</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>贸易区的划定方法有多种：简单缓冲区法（等距圆形）最快但忽略了竞争和路网结构；驾驶时间等时圈更贴合实际出行行为；Huff 模型概率面则能精确反映竞争格局下每个区域的客户分流概率。</p>\n<h2 id=\"可达性分析\">可达性分析</h2><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"python\" data-code=\"import osmnx as ox&#10;import networkx as nx&#10;&#10;G = ox.graph_from_point((39.9042, 116.4074), dist=5000, network_type=&#39;drive&#39;)&#10;&#10;origin = ox.nearest_nodes(G, 116.4074, 39.9042)&#10;&#10;iso_times = [5, 10, 15]  # 分钟&#10;for time_limit in iso_times:&#10;    subgraph = nx.ego_graph(G, origin, radius=time_limit * 60, distance=&#39;travel_time&#39;)&#10;    nodes = list(subgraph.nodes())&#10;    print(f&quot;{time_limit}分钟可达节点数: {len(nodes)}&quot;)\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">import</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> osmnx </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">as</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> ox</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">import</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> networkx </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">as</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> nx</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">G </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> ox.graph_from_point((</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">39.9042</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">116.4074</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">), </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">dist</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">5000</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">network_type</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'drive'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">origin </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> ox.nearest_nodes(G, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">116.4074</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">39.9042</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">iso_times </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> [</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">5</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">10</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">15</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">]  </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># 分钟</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">for</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> time_limit </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">in</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> iso_times:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    subgraph </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> nx.ego_graph(G, origin, </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">radius</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">time_limit </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">*</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 60</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">distance</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'travel_time'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    nodes </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> list</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(subgraph.nodes())</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    print</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">f</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">{</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">time_limit</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">}</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">分钟可达节点数: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">{len</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(nodes)</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">}</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span></code></pre></div><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>可达性指标</th>\n<th>计算方式</th>\n<th>应用</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>等时圈</td>\n<td>从起点出发固定时间可达范围</td>\n<td>服务覆盖评估</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>最近设施距离</td>\n<td>到最近 POI 的路网距离</td>\n<td>公共服务可达性</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>累积机会</td>\n<td>阈值内可达的设施数</td>\n<td>便利性评分</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>重力可达性</td>\n<td>距离衰减加权设施数</td>\n<td>综合可达性</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>可达性分析的精度很大程度上取决于路网数据的质量。OpenStreetMap 是最常用的开放路网数据源，但在某些区域覆盖不完整。商业路网数据（如高德、百度）通常包含更准确的通行时间和交通限制信息。</p>\n<p>多模式出行分析需要整合不同交通方式的路网——步行网络、公交线路、地铁网络和驾车路网。GTFS（General Transit Feed Specification）是公共交通时刻表的标准数据格式，结合 OpenTripPlanner 等路由引擎可以计算多模式等时圈。</p>\n<h2 id=\"空间市场分析\">空间市场分析</h2><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"python\" data-code=\"import geopandas as gpd&#10;from sklearn.cluster import KMeans&#10;&#10;grid = gpd.read_file(&quot;city_grid.shp&quot;)&#10;&#10;features = grid[[&#39;population_density&#39;, &#39;avg_income&#39;,&#10;                  &#39;competitor_count&#39;, &#39;traffic_flow&#39;]].values&#10;&#10;kmeans = KMeans(n_clusters=5, random_state=42)&#10;grid[&#39;segment&#39;] = kmeans.fit_predict(features)&#10;&#10;segment_profiles = grid.groupby(&#39;segment&#39;).agg({&#10;    &#39;population_density&#39;: &#39;mean&#39;,&#10;    &#39;avg_income&#39;: &#39;mean&#39;,&#10;    &#39;competitor_count&#39;: &#39;mean&#39;,&#10;    &#39;traffic_flow&#39;: &#39;mean&#39;,&#10;})\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">import</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> geopandas </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">as</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> gpd</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">from</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> sklearn.cluster </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">import</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> KMeans</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">grid </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> gpd.read_file(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"city_grid.shp\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">features </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> grid[[</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'population_density'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'avg_income'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">                  'competitor_count'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'traffic_flow'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">]].values</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">kmeans </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> KMeans(</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">n_clusters</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">5</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">random_state</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">42</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">grid[</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'segment'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">] </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> kmeans.fit_predict(features)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">segment_profiles </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> grid.groupby(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'segment'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">).agg({</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">    'population_density'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'mean'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">    'avg_income'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'mean'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">    'competitor_count'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'mean'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">    'traffic_flow'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'mean'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">})</span></span></code></pre></div><p>空间市场分析的关键步骤：首先将城市划分为均匀网格或行政区块；然后为每个单元收集多维度特征（人口、收入、竞品、交通等）；接着使用聚类算法识别具有相似特征的区域群组；最后分析每个群组的商业潜力并与现有门店分布对比，识别过度竞争区域和空白市场机会。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>位置智能将空间分析融入商业决策，核心价值是揭示数据的地理维度洞察</li>\n<li>Huff 引力模型是商圈分析的经典方法，平衡了设施吸引力和距离衰减效应</li>\n<li>贸易区划定从简单缓冲区到 Huff 概率面，精度逐步提升</li>\n<li>可达性分析（等时圈、最近设施距离）是选址和公共服务评估的基础工具</li>\n<li>多模式出行分析需要整合步行、公交和驾车等不同交通方式的路网数据</li>\n<li>空间市场细分结合聚类和地理空间，实现精准的区域营销策略</li>\n<li>位置数据的时效性和精度直接决定分析结论的可靠性</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"位置智能","id":"位置智能"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"商圈与贸易区分析","id":"商圈与贸易区分析"},{"level":3,"text":"Huff 引力模型","id":"huff-引力模型"},{"level":2,"text":"可达性分析","id":"可达性分析"},{"level":2,"text":"空间市场分析","id":"空间市场分析"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"地理编码与逆地理编码","url":"/l-doc-books/h/data-science/geospatial-data-analysis/spatial-analysis-methods/geocoding"},"next":{"title":"地理空间可视化","url":"/l-doc-books/h/data-science/geospatial-data-analysis/applied-geospatial/spatial-visualization"}}